WEBVTT

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:09.000
GIRL: One, two, three, four,

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:15.000
five, seven, six,

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.500
six, eight, nine, nine...

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:26.500
MAN (countdown): Ten, nine, eight, seven, six,

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:31.600
five, four, three, two, one, zero.

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:35.000
[explosion]

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:37.200
PRESIDENT JOHNSON: These are the stakes!

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:44.000
To make a world in which all of God's children can live, or to go into the dark.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:50.600
We must either love each other, or we must die.

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:53.800
ANNOUNCER: Vote for President Johnson on November 3.

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:56.900
The stakes are too high for you to stay home.
